OL,3,GNEWSA'Someone will be killed or        
OL,4,Aseriously injured' - mum's warning     
OL,5,Aafter car ramming                      
OL,7,FA woman whose husband, teenage son and 
OL,8,Fa friend were in a car struck by a     
OL,9,Fvehicle moments after it repeatedly    
OL,10,Frammed a police car in Londonderry has 
OL,11,Fsaid they were lucky to escape unhurt. 
OL,13,FLaura Moore said her husband, Don and  
OL,14,F17-year-old son Shea had gone to drop a
OL,15,Ffriend home when their car was struck  
OL,16,Fon Saturday night at Skeoge Link.      
OL,18,FIt was one of three vehicles struck by 
OL,19,Fa red Mercedes during the incident.    
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
