OL,3,GNEWSA'Someone will be killed or        
OL,4,Aseriously injured' - mum's warning     
OL,5,Aafter car ramming                      
OL,7,FA man, aged 21, has since been charged 
OL,8,Fwith a number of offences, which       
OL,9,Finclude dangerous driving, attempted   
OL,10,Fgrievous bodily harm, criminal damage  
OL,11,Fand failing to stop for police.        
